# Conventions Coding SoT

**Role:** naming, ESM/imports, dual-tsconfig, lint/format. **Not:** publish inventory or UX cookbook.

Ownership: [DOC-OWNERSHIP.md](../../.specs/codebase/DOC-OWNERSHIP.md). Lint: `lintConventionsDoc`.

## Forbidden

- `\bM\d+\b`, changelog voice; publish facts → STACK; UX encyclopedias → cli-reference

## Allowed

- `HOTSPOT-*` as naming prefix; `ADR-*`; present-tense conventions; pointers to ARCHITECTURE / AGENTS / STACK / commit-policy

## Sync

Update when conventions change. Milestone-needed prose → ROADMAP/STATE/feature specs.
